{
  "note": "现有实现与上游结构（protocol/codex-app-server/0.163.0）的出入。各入口的 upstream-compat.test.mts 用不声明任何扩展的客户端回放官方桌面端的请求序列、再走一遍常用流程，服务端发来的每条消息都严格校验；实际的出入必须都在这里，这里的每一条也必须还在出现。这份清单只许变短：修掉一条就删一条；新加的扩展内容不许进来，要按连接的声明来发。where 的每一项是“消息类别 方法 位置”。",
  "entries": {
    "claude": [
      {
        "problem": "多出字段 jsonrpc",
        "reason": "信封带了 jsonrpc: \"2.0\"。上游的线上格式不带这个字段（上游自己的客户端会忽略它）。去不去掉待定。",
        "where": [
          "envelope error /",
          "envelope notification /",
          "envelope response /",
          "envelope serverRequest /"
        ]
      },
      {
        "problem": ["多出字段 isPinned", "多出字段 activePermissionProfile"],
        "reason": "会话对象上自己加的字段：置顶和当前的权限档位。上游的 Thread 没有这两个字段（上游的 activePermissionProfile 在 thread/start 这类应答的顶层）。扩展机制之前就有，客户端在读，还没有改成按连接的声明来发。",
        "where": [
          "notification thread/started /thread",
          "response thread/fork /thread",
          "response thread/list /data/*",
          "response thread/metadata/update /thread",
          "response thread/read /thread",
          "response thread/resume /thread",
          "response thread/revert /thread",
          "response thread/rollback /thread",
          "response thread/start /thread",
          "response thread/unarchive /thread"
        ]
      },
      {
        "problem": ["多出字段 permissionProfile", "多出字段 permissions"],
        "reason": "应答顶层多带了权限档位的两种写法；上游 0.163.0 这几个应答里只有 activePermissionProfile、approvalPolicy 和 sandbox。",
        "where": ["response thread/fork /", "response thread/resume /", "response thread/start /"]
      },
      {
        "problem": [
          "多出字段 initialTurnsPage",
          "多出字段 itemsBackwardsCursor",
          "多出字段 turnsBackwardsCursor"
        ],
        "reason": "新建和分叉的应答沿用了恢复会话的形状；上游只有 thread/resume 的应答带首页回合和这两个游标。",
        "where": ["response thread/fork /", "response thread/start /"]
      },
      {
        "problem": [
          "多出字段 activePermissionProfile",
          "多出字段 approvalPolicy",
          "多出字段 approvalsReviewer",
          "多出字段 cwd",
          "多出字段 initialTurnsPage",
          "多出字段 instructionSources",
          "多出字段 itemsBackwardsCursor",
          "多出字段 model",
          "多出字段 modelProvider",
          "多出字段 multiAgentMode",
          "多出字段 permissionProfile",
          "多出字段 permissions",
          "多出字段 reasoningEffort",
          "多出字段 runtimeWorkspaceRoots",
          "多出字段 sandbox",
          "多出字段 serviceTier",
          "多出字段 turnsBackwardsCursor"
        ],
        "reason": "thread/metadata/update 回的是新建会话那样的整包；上游的应答只有 thread。这个入口还让它改模型和权限，客户端靠回来的整包刷新，改之前要先看谁在读。",
        "where": ["response thread/metadata/update /"]
      },
      {
        "problem": ["多出字段 turn_id", "多出字段 started_at"],
        "reason": "时间线里回合边界的条目同时带驼峰和下划线两种写法的字段（有意的，照顾两种读法）；上游线上的是驼峰（见 protocol/schema-corrections/0.163.0.json）。",
        "where": [
          "response thread/timeline/list /data/*<turnCompleted>",
          "response thread/timeline/list /data/*<turnStarted>"
        ]
      },
      {
        "problem": ["多出字段 completed_at", "多出字段 duration_ms"],
        "reason": "同上：时间线里回合结束的条目多出来的下划线写法。",
        "where": ["response thread/timeline/list /data/*<turnCompleted>"]
      }
    ],
    "pi": [
