      {
        "problem": "多出字段 clientId",
        "reason": "回合对象带了客户端提交时给的消息标识；上游只在 userMessage 条目上有 clientId，Turn 上没有。",
        "where": [
          "response thread/fork /thread/turns/*",
          "response thread/read /thread/turns/*",
